			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761590301,
					"content": "這裡是奔狼領？這周圍好像也不像是能處理課業的地方呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590302,
					"content": "這已經是離得最近的「仙靈之庭」了。沒問題，離我們要找的那個「課業起始地」不遠。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590303,
					"content": "嗚哇！那些狼是什麼時候湊近的，那個…我們沒有惡意，我們還認識雷澤呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590304,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590305,
						761590306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "狼群"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590305,
					"content": "狼群離開了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590307
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590307,
					"content": "那孩子還沒有來嗎？或許是時機還未到吧。不過，只要和「盧皮卡」並肩，無論面對任何敵人，那孩子都更勝一籌。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590308,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "狼群"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590309,
					"content": "牠們怎麼又回來了？難道是聽到了我們的話？要是雷澤在就好了，他肯定聽得懂狼群想要說什麼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590310,
					"content": "是啊，但除此之外，他還要懂得更多東西才行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590311,
						761590312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590311,
					"content": "這個地方是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590313
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590313,
					"content": "嗯，那位叫做雷澤的孩子，已經在那場他必定要面對的鏖戰裡取勝了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590314,
					"content": "我想，只要和「盧皮卡」並肩，無論面對任何敵人，那孩子都更勝一籌。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590315,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "狼群"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590316,
					"content": "…他的「盧皮卡」，一定也是這麼想的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590317,
					"content": "好了！這個地方也檢查完畢。累死了，走走走，先回去喝一杯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590318,
					"content": "嗚哇！這扇門是什麼時候出現的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590319,
						761590320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590319,
					"content": "上面怎麼還有貼紙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590321
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590321,
					"content": "這貼紙看起來就像是艾莉絲寫的，上面還有字…我看看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590322,
					"content": "「課業輔導辛苦啦，快點回家喝一杯熱茶吧！」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590323,
					"content": "「另：門內有驚喜！」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590324,
					"content": "回家？等一下，我就說這個門怎麼看起來這麼熟悉，這後面不會通往…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 761590325,
					"content": "#尼可一把推開門，帶著{F#妳}{M#你}們大步跨入其中。隨後，{F#妳}{M#你}們發現自己身處在一間屋子裡…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 761590320,
					"content": "這風格，怎麼感覺有點眼熟…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590321
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590312,
					"content": "我和雷澤在這裡戰鬥過。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590313
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761590306,
					"content": "要在這裡處理課業的人，難道是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761590307
					]
				}
			]
